// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//  W4 STRESS FIXTURE (Phase 69) — deliberately slow synthesis.
//
//  stress_biglen: output == len(xs), proven by six tests whose
//  inputs are lists of length 4000. Every candidate the engine
//  evaluates re-maps and re-traverses those lists, so one
//  seeded playground-profile run takes seconds (≈6 s in Node
//  and headless Chromium at Phase 69) — the slowest case in
//  the profile, used to demonstrate that synthesis in the
//  Web Worker leaves the page interactive and that Cancel
//  terminates a run mid-flight. The winner is the len seed
//  at 6/6/6; the point is the duration, not the difficulty.
//
//  Generated deterministically: test i (0-based) lists
//  (j * (i + 2)) % 23 for j in 0..4000. Regenerate by rule;
//  do not hand-edit the number rows.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

